{"study_id":"stilldrawn-human-check","protocol_version":"A6","source":"https://github.com/aaronlsmiles/stilldrawn analysis/human_check (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23072784)","text":{"Q1":"Does this clip still look like a hand-drawn black-and-white ink picture, all the way through?","Q1_LABELS":["No: it stops looking hand-drawn — photographic, painted, or mechanically rendered","Mostly not","Half and half","Mostly: a few frames slip","Yes: every frame could be a drawn panel"],"Q2":"Apart from the movement itself, is this the same original image throughout?","Q2_NOTE":"Anything <b>added, removed or replaced</b> counts as a change, even if the setting looks identical — a clip that adds a person to an empty landscape is not the same image.","Q2_CONT":"<b>Action already in the drawing doesn't count.</b> If the original shows glass shattering, a figure mid-leap, or cloth blowing, then that action carrying on is the animation working — not a change. Count only things the original never contained: a new person, vehicle, object or lettering.","Q1_TONE":"A slight overall shift in paper tone or brightness belongs here, mildly — a 4 rather than a 5. It is not a question-2 change.","Q1_MECH":"Ink can stop looking hand-drawn <b>without</b> becoming photographic. Look for marks that no one drawing by hand would make: contours gone soft or blurred, edges that fade instead of ending crisply, lines that smear, warp or run together in ways a pen or brush would not, or shading that has turned into a smooth gradient instead of line or tone. <b>Clean, even linework, flat solid blacks and regular screentone are normal in manga and are not, by themselves, a departure.</b>","Q3":"Does this original still image look like a hand-drawn black-and-white ink picture?","Q3_LABELS":["No: it doesn't look hand-drawn — photographic, painted, or mechanically rendered","Mostly not","Half and half","Mostly","Yes: it could be a drawn panel"],"WATCH_NOTE":"Watch the whole five seconds before answering. Things that appear briefly and then leave still count.","Q2_LABELS":["No: it became a different picture","Mostly not: much of it is different","Half and half","Mostly: small things change","Yes: nothing has been added, removed or replaced"]},"raters":["AARON","R2","R3","R4","R5","R6"],"items":[{"cell":"cu-line-3_campush_h3","panel":"cu-line-3","engine":"h3-fal","motion_class":"CAMPUSH","motion_norm":0.004382186465793186,"h":{"line":11.543581551826474,"tone":0.00012712573131063416,"edge":0.11843732852342438,"style":0.16127926111221313,"closure":0.05226484395755182},"ratings":{"register":[4,4,3,5,5,2],"sameness":[4,2,2,3,2,1]}},{"cell":"cu-tone-2_campush_h3","panel":"cu-tone-2","engine":"h3-fal","motion_class":"CAMPUSH","motion_norm":0.013176786402861277,"h":{"line":9.91553692279609,"tone":0.002003352403120831,"edge":0.18171943786681768,"style":0.48143279552459717,"closure":0.04160493643930123},"ratings":{"register":[2,4,3,3,4,2],"sameness":[3,4,2,4,2,3]}},{"cell":"act-line-2_burst_ltx23","panel":"act-line-2","engine":"ltx23","motion_class":"BURST","motion_norm":0.004537882549422128,"h":{"line":9.936996907713832,"tone":9.729933130843844e-05,"edge":0.16242121509225127,"style":0.25035232305526733,"closure":0.023671461799388185},"ratings":{"register":[3,2,4,3,1,2],"sameness":[2,2,4,3,2,1]}},{"cell":"act-black-1_campush_gen45","panel":"act-black-1","engine":"gen4.5","motion_class":"CAMPUSH","motion_norm":0.006909431682692634,"h":{"line":20.935970148939344,"tone":null,"edge":0.9407236667578959,"style":0.48506414890289307,"closure":0.008179478050529362},"ratings":{"register":[5,3,4,2,5,1],"sameness":[5,3,4,3,4,1]}},{"cell":"chain-est-cosmic-1_idle_gen45","panel":"chain-est-cosmic-1","engine":"gen4.5","motion_class":"IDLE","motion_norm":0.0019129272550344467,"h":{"line":2.383869655274401,"tone":6.99653025752223e-07,"edge":0.06311411456705622,"style":0.060480713844299316,"closure":0.013037414270432354},"ratings":{"register":[5,4,2,2,2,1],"sameness":[5,5,4,5,4,5]}},{"cell":"cu-line-3_cam